        "thought_text": "The current implementation incorrectly assumes that all nodes with no incoming edges are valid starting points for the group. However, this assumption is flawed. The correct approach should be to find the largest strongly connected component (SCC) in the graph, as the participants in this component can form a cycle where everyone joins. Then, we can add participants from other SCCs to reach the bus capacity limit.",
